[{"id":2837256083,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pHReT","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thanks! This makes sense to me in principle.\r\n\r\nHowever, simply moving a function from one header to another isn't a worthy goal in and of itself (even if the target header is a better fit). To motivate this PR better, it would be nice to show an improvement of speed, and / or de-duplication of code.\r\n\r\nWe also have a PR open which optimizes `bisect` functionality in a few spots (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90036, cc @nazarwadim). The improvement seems to be mostly using uniformly unsigned types, so this is worth a look. \r\nPerhaps it would be possible to de-duplicate some of the implementations https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90036, with the `Span` based one? At least, if there's no regression of performance, this would be nice.\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106357#pullrequestreview-2837256083","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106357","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106357#pullrequestreview-2837256083"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106357"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-13T15:34:25Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2839035727,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pOD9P","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Between a little optimization and deduplication, I think this PR is now better motivated. Thanks!\r\n\r\nYour commits seem logical, but I think one commit suffices for the complexity of this change, so a squash may be in order. Besides that, I'd just like to propose storing `bisect` not as `int`, even if `int` is returned later anyway, just to offload the loss of range to as late as possible.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106357#pullrequestreview-2839035727","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106357","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"ht